# S-LONGMEM300 recipe for the gain-only 300 s long credit on gpuA (47 GB, dedicated): TWO-VJP-WORKER pool
# (LONGMEM300.md "gpuA expected configs"; exact memory switches only). Sourced by stepZ.sh drylong|prodlong.
# Serial 1-worker fallback: LM_ENV=tools/candA/longmem300_serial.env (+ the serial config, see LAUNCHA.md).
WMS_LM300_RECOMPUTE_REWARD=2
WMS_LM300_PAIRBIAS_CKPT=1
WMS_LM300_TRACE=1
WMS_SPEED_FUTURE_WORKERS=2
WMS_SPEED_FUTURE_VJP_SLOTS=2
WMS_SPEED_FORWARD_WORKERS=3
WMS_SPEED_FUTURE_MEMORY_FRACTION=.40
WMS_SPEED_FORWARD_MEMORY_FRACTION=.26
WMS_SPEED_REPLAY_FORWARD_MEMORY_FRACTION=.02
WMS_SPEED_FUTURE_BUDGET_CAP=.90
C4_GPU_MEM_FRACTION=0.10
